OL,3,GNEWSARare Horrockses housecoat found
OL,4,Aafter appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lost piece of Preston fashion history
OL,7,Fhas been found in Edinburgh following
OL,8,Fan international appeal.
OL,10,FThe 1940s housecoat featuring a map of
OL,11,Fthe British Isles, from Horrockses'
OL,12,Fdebut collection, is believed to be one
OL,13,Fof only two surviving examples of the
OL,14,Fpopular robe.
OL,16,FThe rare garment, first seen on the
OL,17,Fcatwalk on 3 April 1946, will feature
OL,18,Fin a major exhibition celebrating the
OL,19,FLancashire fashion house, which opens
OL,20,Fat The Harris Museum in Preston on
OL,21,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
