OL,3,GNEWSARare Horrockses housecoat found
OL,4,Aafter appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm delighted that the housecoat is
OL,7,Fhaving a visit home," said the
OL,8,Fgarment's owner, a fashion historian
OL,9,Fcurrently studying at the University of
OL,10,FEdinburgh with two decades of
OL,11,Fexperience in vintage fashion.
